WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.043
Learn to create a concrete representation of a given pattern displayed in a table or

00:00:05.043 --> 00:00:09.885
chart and create a table or chart from a given concrete representation of a pattern

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:16.644
A row has 4 dots, the next has 13, and the third has 22. How many in row four? The

00:00:16.644 --> 00:00:19.319
answer is 31. Add 9 dots each new row.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:26.340
A line of bead rows grows from 34 to 39 to 44. How many beads should row five have?

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.925
Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:29.783 --> 00:00:33.303
The answer is 54. Add the fixed increase four times.
